+
+Architecture:
+- Safe Import pattern keeps OTEL optional at runtime.
+- Static typing is exact: every imported name is inferred as a union
+  (real OTEL type | None) and narrowed before use.
+- Without OTEL, `get_tracer()` returns None and `nova_span` yields None;
+  all callers already guard with `if span:`.
